  "description": "Indiathon , powered by E-Cell IIIT Bhubaneswar, is a 14-day startup hackathon where participants turn an idea into a real, working MVP. Participants can participate individually or in teams of up to 4 members. You are free to choose a problem worth solving, develop your startup idea, and build an MVP that demonstrates your solution. Your MVP can be a website, application, prototype, or any other functional solution that effectively demonstrates your startup concept. At the end of the 14-day challenge, participants will submit their project along with a maximum 2-minute video explaining their startup, problem statement, solution, MVP and potential impact. Selected entries will be evaluated, and winners will receive exciting prizes and rewards. Prizes & Rewards: Up to 10 winners can be selected. Rewards include: MacBook iPad ₹25,000 Amazon Voucher ️ E-Cell Goodies ️ Fully Sponsored Trip to Hyderabad / Bangalore",
